            "description": "Get paginated list of curriculum with optional filters.\n\nQuery Parameters:\n- page: Page number (positive integer, default: 1)\n- limit: Items per page (1-100, default: 10)\n- search: Search in name, code, program\n- program: Filter by program name\n- year: Filter by year\n- status: Filter by status (draft, active, inactive)\n\nResponse includes:\n- Curriculum details (code, name, description, program, year)\n- Total units\n- Status and effective date\n- Subject count\n- Pagination metadata"
